            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "The gridded datasets were DDM30 (D\u00f6ll and Lehner, 2002), STN-30p (V\u00f6r\u00f6smarty et al., 2000) and an early version (obtained in May 2011) of the datasets developed by Wu et al. (2012) using the automated dominant-river-tracing algorithm (Wu et al., 2011). This dataset (from here on called DRT) uses a high-resolution baseline, which is a merge between HYDRO1k (USGS EROS, 1996) for high latitudes",
